TheTransformer: {
	TooltipNormal:
		'''
		Generates an aura around you that creates morphing globs when projectiles pass through it or when enemies are killed
		The globs encircle you and deal low damage and knockback to enemies they collide with
		The circle can contain up to 30 globs at once
		Press [KEY] to transform all globs into needles and launch them at your cursor
		'How did this come out of the junk you cobbled together? You're lucky it doesn't transform you'
		'''
	TooltipGFB:
		'''
		Generates an aura around you that creates morphing globs when projectiles pass through it or when enemies are killed
		The globs encircle you and deal low damage and knockback to enemies they collide with
		The circle has no limit to the number of globs it can hold, but your PC might
		Press [KEY] to transform all globs into needles and launch them at your cursor
		'It's no Beeftank Doctrine, but it sure feels breakthrough!'
		'''
}

